---
/** The editor's verdict. Written by a human, never by an agent. */
---
<aside class="not-prose my-12 border-l-4 border-[var(--color-accent)] bg-[var(--color-accent-soft)] px-6 py-6 sm:px-8" aria-label="Verdict">
  <p class="kicker">The verdict</p>
  <div class="mt-3 font-serif text-xl leading-relaxed [&_p+p]:mt-4">
    <slot />
  </div>
  <p class="mt-4 text-xs text-[var(--color-muted)]">Opinion, not a recommendation to buy or sell. See the <a class="underline" href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>
</aside>
